  "content": "<p>這是一個支援包，能讓 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory HUD+</a> 模組的紋理與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 的中世紀風格相匹配。</p><p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">注意：請忽略此包的不相容警告。這只是因為包的格式數值問題，對本特定包並無影響。</span></p><hr><h2><strong>特色功能：</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>重新設計所有背景紋理</strong></li>\n<li><strong>重新設計所有圖示（主手欄位圖示除外）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>重新設計設定介面</strong></li>\n</ul><h2><strong>遊戲內截圖：</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6566c49e-8d7d-4f5b-bb96-9f972e6b4582.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1c207c46-1b3c-45a4-a4c8-8bf7ea3f0e98.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_763c6cbb-e10a-41f6-8547-44ec645d4d64.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2><strong>致謝：</strong></h2><p>Maffhew - 資源包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 的作者</p><p>dmitrylovin - 模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory HUD+</a> 的作者</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>可於以下平台取得：</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/krebton/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1532823/description_25076315-d683-4d08-acbf-ee95582e878d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKrebton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1532823/description_d8c3d4b7-a73d-4e89-b092-3c0a3a74128b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p>",
